OL,3,ATributes paid to 'inspirational'
OL,4,Apresenter and charity founder Esther
OL,5,ARantzen
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen was "an
OL,8,Finspirational individual" who was
OL,9,F"quite a force" as a campaigner,
OL,10,Faccording to the director of Childline,
OL,11,Fthe children's helpline founded by the
OL,12,Fbroadcaster in the 1980s.
OL,14,F"She inspired people, she energised
OL,15,Fpeople, she persuaded people," Shaun
OL,16,FFriel told BBC Breakfast. "She had a
OL,17,Fgreat mind and she had obviously that
OL,18,Fnatural journalistic ability."
