OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATributes paid to 'inspirational'
OL,4,Apresenter and charity founder Esther
OL,5,ARantzen
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther, who died on Wednesday at
OL,8,Fthe age of 86, was known for presenting
OL,9,FBBC consumer show That's Life! for 21
OL,10,Fyears, and for campaigning on issues
OL,11,Fincluding child welfare and assisted
OL,12,Fdying.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham led the
OL,15,Ftributes, saying the veteran
OL,16,Fbroadcaster had "changed countless
OL,17,Flives".
